{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann02_title", "source_sha256": "4b18146e669d62c83a7ae3d2dc917585f071a2d20d5ccecef463af0a83a35911", "ja": "杏奈とおでかけ2", "zh": "和杏奈出游2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "497a77787afad4ed354caea806adedc7a97174057a959736da7635c3214a8c07", "ja": "杏奈とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与杏奈外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ae8ef292271caa79544ad22dc2f3087eba60b27b10522b1725a589d5f4ec22c6", "ja": "（今日は杏奈のリクエストで、水族館にやってきた。\n杏奈、楽しんでるかな……）", "zh": "（今天应杏奈的要求，来到了水族馆。\n不知道杏奈玩得开心吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann02_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "8dfa77e97c1949039ef00ed52560b78554fc0d9e8182efc33e712bc322f6eb83", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\n杏奈……胸が、ドキドキする……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n杏奈……心口，怦怦直跳……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "54018fa9c02f4f349870bfb916c67460cb232a6b09a18fcbf0c98000994893a2", "ja": "えっ……杏奈、大丈夫か？\nどこか具合でも悪いとか……。", "zh": "诶……杏奈，你没事吧？\n是不是哪里不舒服……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann02_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "fef88d3e702f8f9c27644a6818d98ce7cdbfa36d8826df7a68209535aed8e689", "ja": "ううん、ちがい……ます。\n杏奈、うれしくて……えへへ♪", "zh": "没有，不……是的。\n杏奈只是太高兴了……诶嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c233ff1d78d113e65cf47bc6473d70385786dd9aaae120981221a64053e1ee17", "ja": "そうか、それなら良かった。\n杏奈は水族館が好きなのか？", "zh": "这样啊，那就好。\n杏奈喜欢水族馆吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann02_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "20d9550795fd016a8c39713e3ca813d8806509f728bce3108347b6cffb4e0b5f", "ja": "えっと……わかんない……。\n水族館、あんまり……来たこと、ない……から。", "zh": "那个……我不知道……\n因为……没怎么来过水族馆……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann02_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "60b73bc5f70293989222bcd158fd8d72f3cc3b1ae45d14acb335b6f26eb4eab8", "ja": "杏奈のお父さんと、お母さん……忙しいから……\nお休みの日は、遊んでくれたけど……。", "zh": "杏奈的爸爸和妈妈……都很忙……\n虽然休息日会陪杏奈玩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann02_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "86b510c5e0519f6b038d15e78e24eff0668e144b14533446167de9b9e605c194", "ja": "……水族館は、ないかもって……。\nだから、来てみたかった……です。", "zh": "……就觉得可能……不会去水族馆。\n所以，一直很想来……看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f5ad5428307d1898ef161b7331bd3e1646073861c29ce161d2cd5e708025b5bb", "ja": "そうだったのか……じゃあ今日はいっぱい楽しもうな。\n次はシャチを見に行こうか？", "zh": "原来是这样啊……那今天就好好玩个痛快吧。\n接下来要不要去看虎鲸？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann02_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "d9d9508196db56fafb37fb92626170e07b04f1e771574c395d083e9e7eb1342c", "ja": "シャチ……！\nうん……見たい……♪", "zh": "虎鲸……！\n嗯……想看……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6624f55f26390c960ba263b9b18bd4a03abba0fd4d8f4b749bd222f2aaa763aa", "ja": "（杏奈、嬉しそうだな。どんな経験も、\nアイドルの糧になる……今日は楽しんでもらおう！）", "zh": "（杏奈看起来很开心啊。无论什么经历，\n都能成为偶像的养分……今天就让她好好享受吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
